{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大面积、高亮度的白色文字，首先落在首行“他仍不服气，觉得当初那些气不该忍”；下方金色音符动画其次，右上角紫色阶段标题再次。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"仍在纠结过去受过的气，连过去开心的事也不敢多想。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不服气、难受。\",\n  \"missed\": \"如今已经不在那些人身边，想起往事带来失落和眷恋；不服气逐渐淡去，但委屈、火气和不安仍在，最后更多表现为疲惫。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里有好几层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思需要从过去受气、离开熟悉的人、怀念往事及后续情绪变化中逐步确认，要读较长文字才能理解完整处境和感受的关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "082bf88a-ad67-4481-bac8-1044185fa235", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T015128227691Z", "elapsed_seconds": 27.484, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:51:55.703607+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d4bf305816bff9e25e29f695d6dfa4e54fe3ddace63103f6095e300fde27ada4", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238850